<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Bank's Bangkok branch to expand services.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Bank's Bangkok branch to expand services.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Bank Ltd said on Tuesday it would expand its operations in Bangkok later this week to offer a full range of banking and financial services.</p>
<p>&quot;As of March 6, the new Bangkok branch will be able to offer its domestic and international customers a full array of services including Thai baht lending, guarantees, deposits and trade financing,&quot; Sumitomo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
